The number of matches you win in a row
is recorded.{be01}
The record is posted beside the
registration counter.{be01}
It’s also on the back of your
Trainer’s Card.

The Battle Tower is a facility made
especially for Pokémon battles.{be01}
Within the Tower are many Battle Rooms.{be01}
In each Battle Room, seven Trainers
await your challenge.{be01}
Beat all seven, and you will be rewarded
with a fabulous prize.{be01}
You may also take a break from your
challenge by saving your progress.{be01}
Make sure you save properly or you
won’t be able to resume your challenge.

Hahahaha! Pure magnificence!
Pure magnificence indeed!{be01}
Do you realize what you’ve achieved?
You’ve beaten 50 Trainers in a row!{be01}
Yes, purely magnificent!{be01}
As the Owner of the Battle Tower,
let me give you a memento!

